<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Cat FAQ</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #0b1020;
      --panel: #121a2f;
      --panel-2: #18233d;
      --text: #edf2ff;
      --muted: #b7c4e6;
      --accent: #8ab4ff;
      --accent-strong: #b8d2ff;
      --border: #2a395f;
      --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, #1a2850 0%, transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1020 0%, #090d18 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      left: 1rem;
      top: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #09101f;
      font-weight: 700;
      transform: translateY(-160%);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .skip-link:focus {
      transform: translateY(0);
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent-strong);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    main {
      width: min(920px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .hero {
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .intro {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 60ch;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .faq {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .example {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), transparent),
        var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: clip;
    }

    .question {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      text-align: left;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .question:hover {
      background: rgba(138, 180, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .question:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: -3px;
    }

    .question .label {
      min-width: 0;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .chevron {
      flex: none;
      width: 1rem;
      height: 1rem;
      border-right: 2px solid currentColor;
      border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .question[aria-expanded="true"] .chevron {
      transform: rotate(225deg);
    }

    .details {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel-2);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.2rem;
    }

    .details p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .details p + p {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .details ul {
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .details li + li {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      main {
        width: min(100% - 1rem, 920px);
        padding-top: 4.5rem;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 1rem 0.25rem 0;
      }

      .question,
      .details {
        padding-left: 1rem;
        padding-right: 1rem;
      }
    }

    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      :root {
        --bg: Canvas;
        --panel: Canvas;
        --panel-2: Canvas;
        --text: CanvasText;
        --muted: CanvasText;
        --accent: LinkText;
        --accent-strong: LinkText;
        --border: ButtonText;
      }

      .skip-link,
      .example,
      .question:focus-visible {
        forced-color-adjust: auto;
      }

      .example,
      .details,
      .question:focus-visible {
        border-color: ButtonText;
      }

      .question:hover {
        background: Canvas;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h1 id="faq-title">Cat FAQ</h1>
      <p class="intro">A quick collection of common cat questions, answered in a calm, cozy, and slightly dramatic way.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-1" id="cat-question-1-button">
          <span class="label">Why do cats purr?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-1" hidden>
          <p>Cats often purr when they feel relaxed, but they may also purr when they are hungry, anxious, or trying to soothe themselves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-2" id="cat-question-2-button">
          <span class="label">Do cats really land on their feet?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-2" hidden>
          <p>They have a strong righting reflex that helps them twist midair, but a fall can still injure a cat. High places are never safe by default.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-3" id="cat-question-3-button">
          <span class="label">Why do cats knead blankets?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-3" hidden>
          <p>Kneading is a comforting behavior tied to kittenhood. Adult cats may do it when they feel safe, content, or extremely committed to the blanket.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-4" id="cat-question-4-button">
          <span class="label">How many hours do cats sleep?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-4" hidden>
          <p>Many cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, and some even more. This is normal feline behavior and one reason they are experts in resting dramatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-5" id="cat-question-5-button">
          <span class="label">Do cats need to drink a lot of water?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-5" hidden>
          <p>Yes. Fresh water should always be available, and some cats prefer fountains or multiple bowls placed around the home.</p>
          <p>If a cat is drinking much more or much less than usual, a veterinarian should check it out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.question');

    buttons.forEach((button) => {
      const panel = document.getElementById(button.getAttribute('aria-controls'));

      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const expanded = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
        panel.hidden = expanded;
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
