  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h1 id="faq-title">Cat FAQ</h1>
      <p class="intro">A quick collection of common cat questions, answered in a calm, cozy, and slightly dramatic way.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-1" id="cat-question-1-button">
          <span class="label">Why do cats purr?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-1" hidden>
          <p>Cats often purr when they feel relaxed, but they may also purr when they are hungry, anxious, or trying to soothe themselves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-2" id="cat-question-2-button">
          <span class="label">Do cats really land on their feet?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-2" hidden>
          <p>They have a strong righting reflex that helps them twist midair, but a fall can still injure a cat. High places are never safe by default.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-3" id="cat-question-3-button">
          <span class="label">Why do cats knead blankets?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-3" hidden>
          <p>Kneading is a comforting behavior tied to kittenhood. Adult cats may do it when they feel safe, content, or extremely committed to the blanket.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-4" id="cat-question-4-button">
          <span class="label">How many hours do cats sleep?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-4" hidden>
          <p>Many cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, and some even more. This is normal feline behavior and one reason they are experts in resting dramatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-question-5" id="cat-question-5-button">
          <span class="label">Do cats need to drink a lot of water?</span>
          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-question-5" hidden>
          <p>Yes. Fresh water should always be available, and some cats prefer fountains or multiple bowls placed around the home.</p>
          <p>If a cat is drinking much more or much less than usual, a veterinarian should check it out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.question');

    buttons.forEach((button) => {
      const panel = document.getElementById(button.getAttribute('aria-controls'));

